### Skillscope public API: static JSON files regenerated by every build (no server, no key).
### Open in VS Code (REST Client) or JetBrains HTTP Client. Point @base at the published site
### or at the local Docker image (docker compose up --build).
@base = http://localhost:8080

### Index: build id, totals, source status, light list of every repo and derived lists.
GET {{base}}/data/index.json
Accept: application/json

### Conditional request: the site polls like this every 5 minutes. Copy the ETag from the
### previous response; an unchanged index answers 304 with no body.
GET {{base}}/data/index.json
If-None-Match: "paste-the-etag-here"

### Full detail of one category (the exact path with ?v= hash is in index.json -> files).
GET {{base}}/data/detail/code_review.json

### Demand questions (Stack Exchange, CC BY-SA, with attribution), topics and ecosystem gaps.
GET {{base}}/data/demand.json

### Daily series (stars, forks, mentions) for the trend charts.
GET {{base}}/data/signals.json

### Search vectors: int8 LSA embeddings ("SKSE" binary) and their vocabulary.
GET {{base}}/data/embeddings.json

### Weekly bulletin.
GET {{base}}/feed.json

###
GET {{base}}/feed.xml

### Static page per repository (schema.org SoftwareSourceCode) and the sitemap.
GET {{base}}/s/nimbus-labs/pr-review-kit/

###
GET {{base}}/sitemap.xml

### Score badge for a README.
GET {{base}}/badge/nimbus-labs/pr-review-kit.svg

### Health check of the local container (not present on GitHub Pages).
GET {{base}}/healthz
